@inherits LayoutComponentBase

@*
    For the pages somebody sees before they are anybody: sign-in, access denied,
    the error page. No navigation, because every link in it would lead somewhere
    they cannot go yet — a sidebar full of dead ends is a worse first impression
    than no sidebar.
*@

<div class="bare">
    <main class="bare__panel">
        @Body
    </main>

    @*
        The firm's own name rather than one typed in here. See WhoWeAre: this used to be a
        literal, in this file and six others, so renaming the firm on the settings screen
        renamed it on invoices and on nothing a visitor ever saw.
    *@
    <footer class="bare__footer">
        <WhoWeAre />
    </footer>
</div>
